        </camps>
        <plan>Rimfolk_Plan_ChoirRing</plan>
        <honours>a quiet mind, a song held with others and a stranger who listened</honours>
        <fears>the hum going silent, a mind that shouts and the void that listens back</fears>
        <sayings>
          <li>The Spire is thinking.</li>
          <li>We are what it thinks about.</li>
