        </townGoods>
        <ariseAges>0~3</ariseAges>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </FactionDef>

  <!-- ===================== Their people ===================== -->

  <!--
    How alike they look (docs/design/peoples.md, "Release G"): the pale robe in spire lilac on every one of them, and
    nothing else alike: under it whatever they wear, shirts and trousers of the game and the mods, with Royalty the eltex
    of a cantor's or a warden's psychic gear. No armour on anyone (no armour tags; the wardens fight with the mind and a
    light blade). Most are psycasters; a few cantors bards of A RimWorld of Magic, a few wardens its psionics; the first
    voice and some cantors with an archite gene (Biotech), the listeners now and then psy-sensitive by birth. In another age
    their wardens carry the age's own blades (the every-age pass). Without any mod: the game's robes, shirts and trousers,
    knives, and the robe's lilac.
  -->
